/Linux/*.zip

# User-supplied conversion programs: never commit these files.
[Ff][Ff][Mm][Pp][Ee][Gg]
[Ff][Ff][Pp][Rr][Oo][Bb][Ee]
[Ff][Ff][Mm][Pp][Ee][Gg].[Ee][Xx][Ee]
[Ff][Ff][Pp][Rr][Oo][Bb][Ee].[Ee][Xx][Ee]

